    <mxCell id="61" value="Firebase Authentication&#xa;──────────────────────&#xa;Email + Password provider&#xa;Email verification REQUIRED&#xa;  (unverified → sign out + error)&#xa;Password reset via email&#xa;Auth state stream → UI routing&#xa;(AuthenticationWrapper in main.dart)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=8.5;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="935" y="700" width="255" height="120" as="geometry" />
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="62" value="Cloud Firestore&#xa;──────────────────────&#xa;/staff  {staffId, name, dept, email, role, createdAt}&#xa;/roles/{uid}  {role, staffId}&#xa;  ↑ used by Security Rules for role-based access&#xa;/patients  {mrn, name, age, gender, contact,&#xa;  registeredDate, woundAssessmentIds[ ],&#xa;  staffIdAssignedTo, + optional fields}&#xa;/woundAssessments  {patientId, imageUrl,&#xa;  modelPredictedType, modelConfidence,&#xa;  clinicianCorrectedType, clinicianCorrectedName,&#xa;  correctedBy, approvedForTraining, approvedBy,&#xa;  rejectedForTraining, rejectedBy, ...}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=8.5;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
